# The old admin service, superseded by newsletter/ on 2026-09-03 and kept out of the
# repo while the directory still exists locally. Delete the directory and this rule.
admin/

# Internal working notes -- not for the public repo. These MUST stay listed here:
# deploy.sh runs `git add -A`, so anything untracked but not ignored gets swept
# back in on the next deploy without anyone deciding to publish it.
CHANGELOG.md
CLAUDE.md
NEWSLETTER_IMPROVEMENTS.md
PROMOTION.md
TODO.md
TTS_PLAN.md
telemetry.md

# local copy of the OpenAI incident report, not site content
/OpenAI-Hugging-Face*.pdf
